  "B8_graph_rows_explanation": "v3 \"graph\" = backend/query/grounding.py graph_pruned_candidate_ids: the oracle trees are flat (root -> one node per GT object + one region node), so each top-level \"branch\" is a single object node; branch score = |target tokens & node tokens|/|target tokens|; keep nodes >= 0.5*best; if best==0 keep only the lexicographically first child. 4.73 = mean size of that token-overlap-filtered set (ScanNet per-query sizes: 1 x9, 2 x17, 3 x8, 4 x5, 5 x4, 9 x2, 17 x1, 28 x1, 57 x1).",
